      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A direct comparison between as-cast WTaTiVZr and powder-sintered pure tungsten isolates the dual-phase microstructure as the cause of any mechanical-property difference.",
